  "releaseNotes": "- Improved image decoding and encoding fidelity for JPEG, PNG/APNG, GIF, BMP, TIFF, and ICO.\n    - Added configurable decoding limits and stricter malformed-image validation.\n    - Improved EMF/WMF/EMF+ interoperability, vector rendering, text layout, font fallback, and SVG output.",
